OL,3,GNEWSAPatients stranded during airport
OL,4,Adrone disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FMedical procedures had to be cancelled
OL,7,Fafter illegal drone activity disrupted
OL,8,Fflights at Jersey Airport, the
OL,9,Fgovernment has said.
OL,11,FFlights were affected on Friday and
OL,12,FSaturday evenings after unauthorised
OL,13,Fdrones were reported, leading to
OL,14,Fservices being cancelled or diverted to
OL,15,Fother airports, including Paris.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,444,440,260,160,0,100
