OL,3,GNEWSAPatients stranded during airport
OL,4,Adrone disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Government of Jersey said the
OL,7,Fincident "had consequences beyond
OL,8,Fflight disruption", including patients
OL,9,Fwho were receiving treatment in England
OL,10,Funable to return home, the cancellation
OL,11,Fof nine planned clinical procedures and
OL,12,Fone non-emergency air ambulance
OL,13,Ftransfer aborted.
OL,15,FIt said the investigation was ongoing
OL,16,Fand additional measures had been put in
OL,17,Fplace.
